CM_ "Cell voltage frames on C CAN. Signals Cell1..Cell104 use the BMS 1-based cell numbering, matching 0x381 VmaxId/VminId directly (VmaxId N = CellN). Renumbered 2026-07-22 from a prior zero-based scheme (old CellK = new Cell(K+1)); the +1 offset documented in notes/cell-index-mapping.md no longer applies. Bit layout unchanged: 26 frames 0x000-0x019, 4x 16-bit Motorola per frame, 1 mV/bit.";
